        {
          "version": "0.6.1",
          "date": "2025-05-05T01:07:58Z",
          "localizedDescription": "What's Changed\r\n\r\nFixes & Improvements\r\n\r\n\u2022 **AniList**\r\n  \u2022 Fixed a bug where newly added anime would register as *\"Rewatching\"* instead of *\"Plan to watch\"*.\r\n\r\n\u2022 **Kitsu Tracker**\r\n  \u2022 Fixed incorrect display of the \"\u00ec\" character.  \r\n    _Fixes 444_\r\n  \u2022 Replaced placeholder dates (*01 Jan 1970*) with actual **Start date** and **Finish date**, matching MAL.\r\n  \u2022 Updated Kitsu's domain from \".io\" to \".app\".\r\n\r\n\u2022 **Tracker Login (MyAnimeList, Kitsu, AniList)**\r\n  \u2022 Fixed an issue where the access token expiration was not being calculated correctly.\r\n  \u2022 This caused login sessions to appear valid indefinitely, even when they were expired.\r\n  \u2022 Now, the app will correctly detect when a session expires and prompt the user to re\u2022login.\r\n\r\n\u2022 **Library Search**\r\n  \u2022 Added a new checkbox **\"Ignore Filters\"**. When enabled, the search includes the entire library, not just filtered categories (Downloaded, Unwatched/Unread, Started, Bookmarked).  \r\n    _Fixes 349_\r\n\r\n\u2022 **More > Settings > Appearance**\r\n  \u2022 The **\"Follow system theme\"** switch is now always shown at the top, regardless of its state.\r\n  \u2022 Mangayomi now detects system theme changes made while the app was closed and updates accordingly on launch.\r\n\r\n\u2022 **Platform**\r\n  \u2022 Changed app category to **\"AudioVideo\"** for correct classification on Linux systems.\r\n\r\n\u2022 **Player**\r\n  \u2022 Added keyboard shortcut (**Enter key**) to skip anime intros.  \r\n    _Settings > Player > Default Skip Intro Length_\r\n\r\n\u2022 **CBZ Archives**\r\n  \u2022 Fixed CBZ archive creation.  \r\n    _Fixes 435_\r\n\r\n\u2022\u2022\u2022\r\n\r\nNew Feature: Local Media Import\r\n\r\nUsers can now add **Mangas and Animes** to a **manually created** \"local/\" folder inside the app\u2019s home directory.  \r\nThe app will scan this folder once per startup.\r\n\r\n**Folder structure example:**\r\n\"\"\"\r\nApp Home Location/\r\n  local/\r\n    Manga Title/\r\n      cover.jpg (optional)\r\n      Chapter 1/\r\n        1.jpg\r\n        ...\r\n      Chapter 2.cbz\r\n      ...\r\n    Anime Title/\r\n      cover.png (optional)\r\n      Episode 1.mp4\r\n      Episode 2.mkv\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n**Supported filetypes:**\r\n\u2022 **Video**: \"mp4\", \"mov\", \"avi\", \"flv\", \"wmv\", \"mpeg\", \"mkv\"  \r\n\u2022 **Images**: \"jpg\", \"jpeg\", \"png\", \"webp\"  \r\n\u2022 **Archives**: \"cbz\", \"zip\", \"cbt\", \"tar\"\r\n\r\n\u2022\u2022\u2022\r\n\r\nUI Enhancements\r\n\r\n\u2022 Added marquee effect for long episode/chapter titles that overflow the line.\r\n",
          "downloadURL": "https://github.com/NBA2K1/mangayomi/releases/download/v0.6.1/Mangayomi-v0.6.1-ios.ipa",
          "size": 58343730
        }
